---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Tools
description: Free, local-first creative tools. No accounts, subscriptions, telemetry, or uploads.
lang: en
section: tools
permalink: /tools/
translationUrl: /ru/tools/
englishUrl: /tools/
---
<header class="page-heading">
  <p class="eyebrow">Free · local · no account</p>
  <h1>Tools</h1>
</header>
<section class="prose-body">
  <p>Small browser tools that process files on your device. They send no data to a server and require no account.</p>
  <ul class="index-list">
    {% for tool in tools %}
      <li>
        {% if tool.url %}<a href="{{ tool.url }}">{{ tool.name }}</a>{% else %}<strong>{{ tool.name }}</strong>{% endif %}
        <span class="stamp">{{ tool.status }}</span>
        {% if tool.description.en %}<p class="description">{{ tool.description.en }}</p>{% endif %}
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
